{
  "id": "b2ce9da629b5f5fb",
  "name": "00 Inbox triage (free): label, route, draft (never send)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyMinute"
            }
          ]
        },
        "simple": true,
        "filters": {
          "readStatus": "unread"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "5d1c0a10-0b1e-4d1a-9a10-000000000001",
      "name": "New email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmailTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Read the email below.\nReturn exactly one label from: invoice, meeting, newsletter, support, other.\nReturn only the label.\n\nSubject: {{ $json.Subject }}\nBody: {{ $json.snippet }}",
        "batching": {}
      },
      "id": "5d1c0a10-0b1e-4d1a-9a10-000000000002",
      "name": "Pick a label",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "claude-haiku-5-5"
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0
        }
      },
      "id": "5d1c0a10-0b1e-4d1a-9a10-000000000003",
      "name": "Anthropic Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatAnthropic",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [
        240,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": false,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "c1",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.text.trim().toLowerCase() }}",
                    "rightValue": "invoice",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "c2",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.text.trim().toLowerCase() }}",
                    "rightValue": "meeting",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "c3",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.text.trim().toLowerCase() }}",
                    "rightValue": "support",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "or"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "Draft a reply"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "fallbackOutput": "extra",
          "renameFallbackOutput": "Label only"
        }
      },
      "id": "5d1c0a10-0b1e-4d1a-9a10-000000000004",
      "name": "Route by label",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [
        520,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "draft",
        "subject": "={{ 'Re: ' + $('New email').item.json.Subject }}",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "=Hi,\n\nThanks for your email. I have received it and will reply properly soon.\n\nBest,\nYOUR NAME (CHANGE ME)",
        "options": {
          "threadId": "={{ $('New email').item.json.threadId }}",
          "sendTo": "={{ $('New email').item.json.From.match(/<([^>]+)>/)?.[1] ?? $('New email').item.json.From }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "5d1c0a10-0b1e-4d1a-9a10-000000000005",
      "name": "Save draft (not sent)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        800,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Inbox triage (free)\nEvery minute it reads new unread Gmail, asks the model for one label (invoice, meeting, newsletter, support, other) and, for invoice / meeting / support, saves a short holding reply as a **draft in the same thread**. Nothing is ever sent or deleted; newsletters and other mail are left alone.\n\n**1. Credentials** (Credentials > Add): [Gmail OAuth2](https://docs.n8n.io/integrations/builtin/credentials/google/oauth-single-service/) on \"New email\" and \"Save draft\", and an [Anthropic](https://docs.n8n.io/integrations/builtin/credentials/anthropic/) key on the chat model. Prefer OpenAI? Replace \"Anthropic Chat Model\" with \"OpenAI Chat Model\" and connect it the same way.\n\n**2. CHANGE ME**: the signature in \"Save draft (not sent)\".\n\n**3. Test**: send yourself an email that looks like an invoice, open Executions, then check Gmail Drafts.\n\n**Cost**: one short model call per email, a fraction of a cent on a small model (Claude Haiku / GPT-4.1 mini).\nTested 2026-10-18 on n8n 2.42.3 with a test Gmail mailbox.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "a3959dd1-65e4-455e-aad6-9b227b4c28b6",
      "name": "Setup notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -520
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "New email": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Pick a label",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Anthropic Chat Model": {
      "ai_languageModel": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Pick a label",
            "type": "ai_languageModel",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Pick a label": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Route by label",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Route by label": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Save draft (not sent)",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        []
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "active": false
}
